{"data": [{"author_id": "2091191689499316224", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120876768600994005"], "id": "2120876768600994005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "出生人口下降，最先变的不是高考，是幼儿园。\n\n幼儿园先招不满，然后小学合并，再然后才是中学、大学。\n\n所以讨论“孩子少了竞争就小了”，要问一句：你说的是哪一年？\n\n2043 年高考的人，今年刚出生。你现在焦虑的考试，跟出生人口没关系。", "url": "https://x.com/ofrbkj/status/2120876768600994005"}, {"author_id": "2117517033713897472", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:00:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120396300067987587"], "id": "2120396300067987587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 97, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "幼儿园、小学、初中学龄人口已经达峰，对教育行业意味着什么？哪些新变化值得关注？\n\n人口出生的高峰期是在2016年，那时刚放开二胎，新出生人口达到1883万人，随后基本上就开启下降通道，到2025年时，新出生人口只有792万人。", "url": "https://x.com/JohnSimthxe7f/status/2120396300067987587"}, {"author_id": "1724204015733407744", "created_at": "2026-11-11T05:44:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120392138559037515"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cJBpGNLqqJ", "end": 199, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RealBoboTon/status/2117481690667127094/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117481218698788864", "start": 176, "url": "https://t.co/cJBpGNLqqJ"}]}, "id": "2120392138559037515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 184, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "先说事实：\n2025年中国全年出生人口为 792万人，\n1949年以来年出生人口首次跌破800万。", "url": "https://x.com/sunny230713/status/2120392138559037515"}, {"author_id": "1526940839833763843", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:46:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120437876340994217"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 37, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 32, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2120437876340994217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突然有点好奇\n\n今年中国的新出生人口会有多少，去年是792万\n\n@grok帮我预测下", "url": "https://x.com/wenjieHe20/status/2120437876340994217"}, {"author_id": "1562136801183027200", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:19:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120491486274068682", "2120491622614118515"], "id": "2120491486274068682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "盘点各国未能顺利出生人口🥺\n\n🇬🇱 格陵兰：59.09%\n🇬🇵 瓜德罗普：48.34%\n🇨🇺 古巴：47.62%\n🇲🇶 马提尼克：45.57%\n🇦🇿 阿塞拜疆：43.34%\n🇧🇶 博奈尔：38.90%\n🇨🇳 中国大陆：7…显示更多%", "url": "https://x.com/pnsin1/status/2120491486274068682"}, {"author_id": "1562136801183027200", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:19:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120491486274068682", "2120491622614118515"], "id": "2120491622614118515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 452, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "盘点各国未能顺利出生人口🥺\n\n🇬🇱 格陵兰：59.09%\n🇬🇵 瓜德罗普：48.34%\n🇨🇺 古巴：47.62%\n🇲🇶 马提尼克：45.57%\n🇦🇿 阿塞拜疆：43.34%\n🇧🇶 博奈尔：38.90%\n🇨🇳 中国大陆：7…显示更多", "url": "https://x.com/pnsin1/status/2120491622614118515"}, {"author_id": "1476875692969119747", "created_at": "2026-11-12T00:12:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120671078343418203"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/niannia3453587…", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/niannia34535878/status/2120592065751035984", "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/7ZUwHQfCUD"}]}, "id": "2120671078343418203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "16万是全国954万出生人口的结构差额，不是浓度，不能拿8.49万当水兑。你按比例一缩变1400，那按同比例缩男性每年比女性多死150多万，北京也得“没”两千多，你咋不说？。 https://t.co/7ZUwHQfCUD", "url": "https://x.com/micaifu2/status/2120671078343418203"}, {"author_id": "15315460", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:25:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120432722242097276"], "id": "2120432722242097276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 850, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "刷​⁣⁣⁣‌‌⁣⁣⁣⁣‌⁣‌‌⁣⁣‌⁣‌‌‌⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣‌‌⁣‌⁣⁣‌⁣⁣⁣⁣‌‌⁣‌⁣⁣⁣‌⁣‌‍到个短视频\n说卫生巾销量下滑\n这不是很正常嘛\n\n人口数量最大的那波（女）人\n陆续进入绝经期\n后面几拨出生人口数量又指数级下降\n与人口数量叠加顶峰期相比\n下滑太正常了", "url": "https://x.com/fooarch/status/2120432722242097276"}, {"author_id": "1516238983000637442", "created_at": "2026-11-12T07:53:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120786984218075480"], "id": "2120786984218075480", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 211, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "目前的学校和老师，是按照人口高峰期，每年2000万出生人口配置的。\n\n目前实际出生人口，每年700多万。\n\n幼儿园先倒闭，去年倒闭了2.6万幼儿园。\n\n小学随后倒闭，紧接着是大学倒闭，校园合并 和 老师下岗是大势所趋。\n\n校园合并，大部分学区房的学区溢价，将会被抹平。", "url": "https://x.com/Zhibin992/status/2120786984218075480"}, {"author_id": "1867208440336265216", "created_at": "2026-11-12T09:33:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120812191599526069"], "id": "2120812191599526069", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "目前的学校和老师，是按照人口高峰期，每年2000万出生人口配置的。\n\n目前实际出生人口，每年700多万。\n\n幼儿园先倒闭，去年倒闭了2.6万幼儿园。\n\n小学随后倒闭，紧接着是大学倒闭，校园合并 和 老师下岗是大势所趋。\n\n校园合并，大部分学区房的学区溢价，将会被抹平。", "url": "https://x.com/666LoneRanger/status/2120812191599526069"}, {"author_id": "1846031631905353728", "created_at": "2026-11-12T08:28:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120795867435483645"], "id": "2120795867435483645", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 249, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国已经开始的九大现象：\n\n1. 大拆大建，不会再有\n2.铁饭碗，不会在铁\n3.房价，不会在无序上涨\n4.互联网流量见底\n5.新生儿，出生人口下降\n6.实体店，被电商冲垮\n7.汽车越来越便宜\n8.电瓶单车大量投放\n9.人人都离不开手机", "url": "https://x.com/qingdao114515/status/2120795867435483645"}, {"author_id": "1450040510316310528", "created_at": "2026-11-12T11:13:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120837428093317541"], "id": "2120837428093317541", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 981, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "陈水扁八年，出生人口从30.8万大跌到19.8万，\n\n马英九八年，从19.8万小涨到20.9万，\n\n蔡英文八年，从20.9万大跌到13.5万，\n\n赖清德四年，预计再跌到十万以下。\n\n无声无息消灭百万台湾人，共产党做不到的，民进党真的做到了。\n\n看得出来，他们真的很努力了。😹😹😹", "url": "https://x.com/FeiyanXie/status/2120837428093317541"}, {"author_id": "1080593132482260992", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:36:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120284404375507346"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oX2fXYaCJ5", "end": 196, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Stanley_Liu2018/status/2120284404375507346/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120284389833940992", "start": 173, "url": "https://t.co/oX2fXYaCJ5"}]}, "id": "2120284404375507346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 227, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【2026年台湾出生人口】\n\n口径：内政部户政统计，截至2026年10月\n\n今年1–10月：77,481人\n10月单月：8,035人\n全年预计：约9.5万人（估算）\n2025年全年：107,812人\n2024年全年：134,856人\n2023年全年：135,571人\n\n---\n\n【结论】\n今年将再创历史新低，比去年再少约12%\n连续十一年下降 https://t.co/oX2fXYaCJ5", "url": "https://x.com/Stanley_Liu2018/status/2120284404375507346"}, {"author_id": "163713680", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120424539331138027"], "id": "2120424539331138027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "发改委今天说了个大拐点，幼儿园、小学、初中的学龄人口已经达峰了～😈\n\n         十四五这几年在校生少了将近1700万人，去年出生人口792万，只有2016年高峰的一半多一点～🕐\n\n         学校关得也快，去年小学少了8000所，幼儿园少了2.14万所～😓", "url": "https://x.com/yangye01/status/2120424539331138027"}, {"author_id": "99301062", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:34:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120857692759892302"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Fv5fuIlBAY", "end": 127, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/santoulang/status/2120857692759892302/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120857685189132288", "start": 104, "url": "https://t.co/Fv5fuIlBAY"}]}, "id": "2120857692759892302", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1834, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小红书许磊：我国每年女性流产人次大约在800万到1300万之间\n\n小红书副总裁许磊今天在财新年会上表示，中国每年女性流产人次大约在800万到1300万之间，这个数字相对稳定，不会随着人口出生率的下降而下降。 https://t.co/Fv5fuIlBAY", "url": "https://x.com/santoulang/status/2120857692759892302"}, {"author_id": "1239341587555115014", "created_at": "2026-11-12T02:46:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120709807133135146"], "id": "2120709807133135146", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "谈谈教育：\n根据出生人口数量变化图我们可以看到，中国从幼儿园到初中，生源规模已经到顶，高中和大学的生源规模还在上涨。孩子数量变少，不等于不用再竞争，压力只是换到了学段。\n\n五年间，幼儿园、小学、初中的在校生合计少了近 1700 万；但大城市的学位仍然紧张，能上学不等于能上好学校。", "url": "https://x.com/Huluwa678/status/2120709807133135146"}, {"author_id": "23585341", "created_at": "2026-11-11T05:28:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120388065533493403"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nYOvUhy8Zh", "end": 69, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/gordon758/status/2120388065533493403/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120387760934854656", "start": 46, "url": "https://t.co/nYOvUhy8Zh"}]}, "id": "2120388065533493403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 188, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "昨天发改委发话，幼儿园、小学、初中，学龄人口全达峰了（有点奇怪，怎么会是发改委来说这事）。 https://t.co/nYOvUhy8Zh", "url": "https://x.com/gordon758/status/2120388065533493403"}, {"author_id": "3868328413", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:17:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120324896572264595"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/a3L1KTNd5s", "end": 116, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Tong_Shuo/status/2120324896572264595/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120324890855350272", "start": 93, "url": "https://t.co/a3L1KTNd5s"}]}, "id": "2120324896572264595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【台灣人口連續34個月下降】\n台灣內政部門10日公布最新統計，截至今年10月底，台灣總人口降至2320.4萬人，較上月減少9251人，連續34個月下降，少子化與人口老齡化問題持續加劇。 https://t.co/a3L1KTNd5s", "url": "https://x.com/Tong_Shuo/status/2120324896572264595"}, {"article": {"title": "马江博-政经参考2026-223：经济大省今年猛抢年轻人，到了令人惊讶的地步 "}, "author_id": "2120359799175213056", "created_at": "2026-11-12T04:01:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120728751101374562"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2120…", "end": 53, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120728603428274176", "start": 30, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120728603428274176", "url": "https://t.co/wfFQAJW0Wl"}]}, "id": "2120728751101374562", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "如果您想观看全文，请订阅支持原作者，本文只做概括推广使用。 https://t.co/wfFQAJW0Wl", "url": "https://x.com/carterethan2026/status/2120728751101374562"}, {"author_id": "1815793493526360065", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:16:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120430355207594417"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/wizargod/statu…", "end": 116, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/wizargod/status/2120419353111765294", "start": 93, "url": "https://t.co/kCJJabVdRB"}]}, "id": "2120430355207594417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 747, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "美国人口结构自20世纪中后期（尤其是1965年《移民与国籍法》后）确实发生了显著变化，与“移民较少”的时期相比，现在的构成、社区和文化已不再相同。\n\n基于最新普查与研究数据的关键变化： https://t.co/kCJJabVdRB", "url": "https://x.com/WizarGod/status/2120430355207594417"}, {"author_id": "51429844", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:49:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120634945173619199"], "entit